# LF everywhere, on every platform. Git for Windows (and GitHub's Windows
# runners) default to core.autocrlf=true, which would check the template
# corpus out with CRLF — and cmake/EmbedTemplates.cmake embeds those bytes
# verbatim, so every project a Windows-built cup scaffolds would carry them,
# and the suites that compare rendered output exactly would fail.
* text=auto eol=lf
